-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: .05 kg (0.1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Second floor of <a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-134&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-186</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers#Ketheric's_room\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Ketheric's Room</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-161&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-174</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[A map of Baldur's Gate, depicting Upper City, Lower City, and Outer City as far as Wyrm's Crossing, as well as Grey Harbour and the near course of the Chionthar. Arrows show the intended progress of the armies of the Absolute, with weak points in the city defences marked with X.]\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714230004\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.038 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1345/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 17573/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5072/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion d